From d1e2ec440c742d6095a75f445f4fa8b71128ba95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Rowlinson <mrowlinson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:11:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] avcodec/ac4: add encoder core + lib adapter

Encoding engine (enc_core_*), support DSP (bits, asf, mdct,
loudness), algorithm modules (mc3, jshort, tail59, aspx, acpl),
the pycompat port shim, and the ac4enc_lib adapter (measured-
loudness pass, bake API) the lavc wrapper calls into. Includes
the C1 table headers; still no lavc API surface, so nothing
links this in until the wrapper patch.

Re-cut (r3): re-vendor the core from parent master 9c7fb2e
(R3 loud-refusal guards + EL-minors + S5FU stereo x2.0 staging +
LLONG_MAX iframe guard (FUZZ-CENC crash-2) + F2 comment refresh;
same M3 rename, pipeline-validated 33/33 byte-exact) and prepend
the LGPL header block to all 27 files (X2). Stereo bytes change
(x2.0); 5.1 bytes are untouched.

Re-cut (r6): M10 _tab includes; M13 port_sincos via HAVE_SINCOS
(configure probe in 03/10; no Apple __sincos, no bare sincos);
M14 mechanical raw->av_ conversion (298 calls, 10 files);
M15 delete _Thread_local diagnostic + getters (lib ctx already
carries err_detail; wrapper reads that in 03/10). No behavior
change on valid inputs.

Signed-off-by: Michael Rowlinson <mrowlinson@gmail.com>
